html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "2.9", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "bbh_z_ref", "argument": "--bbh-z-ref", "type": "float", "label": "Redshift of the BBH rate", "help": "Redshift at which the evolving BBH rate is reported.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "0.2", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "catalogs", "argument": "--catalogs", "type": "select", "label": "Catalogs", "help": "Catalog keys (GWTC-1 GWTC-2.1 GWTC-3 GWTC-4 GWTC-4.1 GWTC-5, or ALL): events and injections are restricted to their observing runs (GWTC-1: O1-O2, GWTC-2.1: O3a, GWTC-3: O3b, GWTC-4: O4a, GWTC-4.1: O4a, GWTC-5: O4b). Default: the runs of the real-injection mixture (O3 onward).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "options": [["GWTC-1", "GWTC-1", false], ["GWTC-2.1", "GWTC-2.1", false], ["GWTC-3", "GWTC-3", false], ["GWTC-4", "GWTC-4", false], ["GWTC-4.1", "GWTC-4.1", false], ["GWTC-5", "GWTC-5", false], ["ALL", "ALL", false]], "display": "checkboxes", "multiple": true, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "snr_threshold", "argument": "--snr-threshold", "type": "float", "label": "SNR threshold of the O1\u2013O2 injections", "help": "Network SNR threshold for the semi-analytic O1+O2 injections (with GWTC-1).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "10.0", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "mass_model", "argument": "--mass-model", "type": "select", "label": "Mass model", "help": "Mass model: plp = Power Law + Peak (GWTC-3 values unless 