rce.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "zenodo", "options": [["zenodo", "zenodo", true], ["s3", "s3", false], ["galaxy", "galaxy", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "hubble_constant_bright", "inputs": [{"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "sensitivity_release", "argument": "--sensitivity-release", "type": "select", "label": "Search-sensitivity release", "help": "LVK search-sensitivity release (and matching catalogs and runs): gwtc4 = GWTC-4.0 cumulative, semi-analytic O1+O2 + real O3+O4a injections; gwtc5 = GWTC-5.0 cumulative, semi-analytic O1+O2 + real O3+O4a+O4b injections.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "gwtc4", "options": [["gwtc4", "gwtc4", true], ["gwtc5", "gwtc5", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "sensitivity_file", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Injection file", "help": "Local LVK injection mixture file (semi-analytic O1+O2 + real) instead of the release's.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["h5"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_3590"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "far_threshold", "argument": "--far-threshold", "type": "float", "label": "False-alarm-rate threshold (per year)", "help": "FAR threshold [1/yr] for the events and the real injections.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "0.25", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "snr_threshold", "argument": "--snr-threshold", "type": "float", "label": "SNR threshold of the O1\u2013O2 injections", "help": "Network SNR threshold for the semi-analytic O1+O2 injections.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "10.0", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "event", "argument": "--event", "type": "text", "label": "Event", "help": "Event: one of the built-in list of known counterparts (GW170817, GW190521), which gives its counterpart's position, host redshift and PE file; or any event of the GWTC PE releases (full name GWYYMMDD_HHMMSS) with --ra, --dec and --redshift, e.g. the afterglow of a coincident GRB and its host.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "GW170817", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "ra", "argument": "--ra", "type": "float", "label": "Right ascension of the counterpart (deg)", "help": "Right ascension of the counterpart (deg).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "dec", "argument": "--dec", "type": "float", "label": "Declination of the counterpart (deg)", "help": "Declination of the counterpart (deg).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "pe_label", "argument": "--pe-label", "type": "text", "label": "PE analysis (label)", "help": "Analyses of the PE file to use, by label (one waveform model and prior each, e.g. C02:IMRPhenomPv2_NRTidal-HighSpin): one result per label, plots from the first. Default: the labels set for the event (GW190521: C01:IMRPhenomXPHM), else all those of the file, LowSpin first.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "pe_file", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "PE file", "help": "PE file to read instead of the event's.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["h5"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_3590"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "v_recession", "argument": "--v-recession", "type": "text", "label": "Recession velocity of the host (km/s)", "help": "2 numbers separated by a space. Recession velocity of the host and its uncertainty, km/s (default for GW170817: 3327 72, the NGC 4993 group in the CMB frame).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "v_peculiar", "argument": "--v-peculiar", "type": "text", "label": "Peculiar velocity of the host (km/s)", "help": "2 numbers separated by a space. Peculiar velocity of the host and its uncertainty, km/s (default for GW170817: 310 150).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "redshift", "argument": "--redshift", "type": "text", "label": "Host redshift and uncertainty", "help": "2 numbers separated by a space. Hubble-flow redshift of the host and its uncertainty, instead of the velocities (default for GW190521: 0.438 0.0015).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "host", "argument": "--host", "type": "text", "label": "Host galaxy", "help": "Name of the host galaxy (for an event outside the list).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "counterpart_class", "argument": "--counterpart-class", "type": "select", "label": "Class of the binary", "help": "Class of the binary, the mass model of the selection (default: the event's, or for an event outside the list BNS when both catalog masses are below 3 M_sun, else BBH).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "options": [["BNS", "BNS", false], ["BBH", "BBH", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "FloatToolParameter", "name": "sky_radius", "argument": "--sky-radius", "type": "float", "label": "Sky radius (deg)", "help": "For samples not fixed to the counterpart's position: keep those within this angle (deg).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": null, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "3.0", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "viewing_angle", "argument": "--viewing-angle", "type": "text", "label": "Viewing-angle constraint (deg)", "help": "2 numbers separated by a space. Independent Gaussian constraint on the viewing angle (deg, 0-90), e.g. from the jet; weights the PE samples.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "pe_distance_prior", "argument": "--pe-distance-prior", "type": "select", "label": "Distance prior of the PE samples", "help": "Luminosity-distance prior of the PE samples, divided out of the distance posterior: dl2 (D_L^2), comoving or source-frame (uniform in comoving volume, or in comoving volume and source-frame time; Planck15_LAL). Default: the prior recorded in the PE file, else D_L^2 up to O3 and source-frame from O4.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "options": [["dl2", "dl2", false], ["comoving", "comoving", false], ["source-frame", "source-frame", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "selection", "argument": "--selection", "type": "select", "label": "Selection term", "help": "Selection term: euclidean (GW-limited, nearby sources: beta \u221d H0^3), injections (LVK sensitivity injections of the event's run), auto (euclidean below z = 0.05, injections above or with --population fullpop4).", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "auto", "options": [["auto", "auto", true], ["euclidean", "euclidean", false], ["injections", "injections", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "population", "argument": "--population", "type": "select", "label": "Population of the sources", "help": "Population of the sources: volume (uniform in comoving volume and source-frame time; with injections, the mass model of the class, Power Law + Peak or uniform neutron stars, weights both the PE samples and the selection) or fullpop4 (FullPop-4.0 masses and the Madau-Dickinson rate fixed to the GWTC-4.0 spectral-siren medians, as the GWTC-4.0 reanalysis of GW170817; selection by injections with --sele